Dear RT Folks,

I'm pleased to announce the 3.2.58-rt85 stable release.


This release is just an update to the new stable 3.2.58 version
and no RT specific changes have been made.


You can get this release via the git tree at:

  git://git.kernel.org/pub/scm/linux/kernel/git/rt/linux-stable-rt.git

  branch: v3.2-rt
  Head SHA1: ce1f866ababdaf3bc8937f86442cbe969decda00


Or to build 3.2.58-rt85 directly, the following patches should be applied:

  http://www.kernel.org/pub/linux/kernel/v3.x/linux-3.2.tar.xz

  http://www.kernel.org/pub/linux/kernel/v3.x/patch-3.2.58.xz

  http://www.kernel.org/pub/linux/kernel/projects/rt/3.2/patch-3.2.58-rt85.patch.xz




Enjoy,

-- Steve

